1
00:00:00,993 --> 00:00:02,300
Can you check how
much we earned?

2
00:00:02,307 --> 00:00:04,255
- Here it is!
- Two hundred…

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,013
Kuya Chard, Kuya Je!

4
00:00:07,038 --> 00:00:11,637
How many times do I have to tell
you not to leave the oven unattended?

5
00:00:12,404 --> 00:00:13,404
There!

6
00:00:13,603 --> 00:00:15,650
We burned the bread again!

7
00:00:15,675 --> 00:00:17,042
Sorry, sorry…

8
00:00:17,348 --> 00:00:21,475
Sorry… because… Tita, I know… Tito,
I know you’re listening… I’m really sorry.

9
00:00:22,336 --> 00:00:23,730
Lola, I’m sorry.

10
00:00:23,755 --> 00:00:25,915
It won’t happen again.
It’s just a simple mistake.

11
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,353
- It just happened.
- BFF!

12
00:00:27,826 --> 00:00:29,266
Good morning, BFF!

13
00:00:29,291 --> 00:00:31,847
Don’t “good morning” me!

14
00:00:31,872 --> 00:00:33,124
- Why?
- Don’t “good morning” me!

15
00:00:33,149 --> 00:00:34,996
- Why? What’s up with me?
- Why?

16
00:00:35,041 --> 00:00:37,141
Are you paying up?
When are you going to pay your debt?

17
00:00:37,165 --> 00:00:38,405
Good thing you brought that up.

18
00:00:38,671 --> 00:00:40,078
We’re working on it.

19
00:00:40,103 --> 00:00:41,103
Working on what?

20
00:00:41,128 --> 00:00:42,850
The house…
we just have a bit of a—

21
00:00:42,875 --> 00:00:45,527
A bit of what?
A bit of an excuse?

22
00:00:45,552 --> 00:00:47,260
Tso K, Tso K… wait, hold on.

23
00:00:47,786 --> 00:00:50,513
Wow. You’re so harsh,
that hurts!

24
00:00:50,687 --> 00:00:54,161
We’re not even late
with payments, right?

25
00:00:54,366 --> 00:00:57,766
No, no, no, Tita. Don’t worry.

26
00:00:58,696 --> 00:01:00,876
Please excuse Tso K,

27
00:01:01,177 --> 00:01:04,751
he just woke up on the
wrong side of the bed.

28
00:01:04,884 --> 00:01:06,890
It’s okay, it’s okay.
I understand.

29
00:01:06,956 --> 00:01:08,610
Excuse him?
Why are you like that?

30
00:01:08,691 --> 00:01:10,704
When we talked,
you said it was firm.

31
00:01:10,729 --> 00:01:11,729
Hold on, Tso K…

32
00:01:13,205 --> 00:01:14,205
Yes, yes, yes?

33
00:01:15,718 --> 00:01:18,271
Tito… Tita…

34
00:01:18,697 --> 00:01:19,697
Yes?

35
00:01:20,401 --> 00:01:23,127
You know what, maybe don’t
worry about the payment for now.

36
00:01:23,152 --> 00:01:24,644
Please, don’t.

37
00:01:24,668 --> 00:01:27,588
- Huh? Really?
- I’ll talk to Tso K.

38
00:01:28,027 --> 00:01:29,654
I’ll handle it.

39
00:01:29,797 --> 00:01:32,194
- Just pay when able.
- Hey, hey!

40
00:01:32,218 --> 00:01:33,694
- Pay when able?
- Oh no!

41
00:01:33,718 --> 00:01:34,959
What do you mean pay when able?

42
00:01:34,983 --> 00:01:37,727
That’s not allowed—
what are you thinking?

43
00:01:38,654 --> 00:01:39,654
Wow!

44
00:01:39,832 --> 00:01:41,652
Pay when able?
Hannah!

45
00:01:41,676 --> 00:01:44,919
Oh my, thank you so much.

46
00:01:44,943 --> 00:01:46,356
You’re really so kind!

47
00:01:46,357 --> 00:01:48,303
Oh, you’re welcome!
You’re welcome!

48
00:01:48,328 --> 00:01:50,986
- You’re welcome! You’re welcome!
- Thank you!

49
00:01:51,249 --> 00:01:53,842
What is Hannah up
to this time again?

50
00:01:56,917 --> 00:02:02,227
What plan or gimmick is Hannah
cooking up again? Or are

51
00:02:02,946 --> 00:02:05,706
Tasha and I about to
get really pissed off?

52
00:02:07,003 --> 00:02:08,003
Watch out

53
00:02:08,373 --> 00:02:11,190
for whose temper blows up first,

54
00:02:11,214 --> 00:02:12,574
in the next epi—huh?

55
00:02:13,426 --> 00:02:15,497
What are you talking about?

56
00:02:15,651 --> 00:02:19,831
Manong, get back to your station
before you burn the food again!

57
00:03:23,090 --> 00:03:24,950
- What happened to you?
- Why?

58
00:03:24,975 --> 00:03:26,383
Why are you suddenly soft?

59
00:03:26,601 --> 00:03:28,921
Weren’t you—what is this?
Weren’t we supposed to be at war?

60
00:03:30,606 --> 00:03:32,153
Tso K, Tso K, Tso K!

61
00:03:33,076 --> 00:03:35,400
We already tried that before,
and didn’t we lose?

62
00:03:35,425 --> 00:03:37,802
This time,
let’s change our strategy.

63
00:03:37,942 --> 00:03:38,942
How?

64
00:03:39,002 --> 00:03:40,002
Simple, Tso K.

65
00:03:41,269 --> 00:03:47,713
We gain the family’s trust,
and once we do—boom!

66
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:53,319
I like that…
the one where the rage explodes.

67
00:03:53,392 --> 00:03:55,867
- I want it deep—deep, okay?
- Deep and intense!

68
00:03:55,892 --> 00:03:57,887
That made me laugh,
but I didn’t get it.

69
00:03:59,196 --> 00:04:00,498
- Hey! What’s so funny?
- Uh…

70
00:04:00,529 --> 00:04:03,509
You’re just like a
soap opera, seriously.

71
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:05,159
A soap opera?

72
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:07,473
Ah…you’re trying to speak
English now, it shows.

73
00:04:07,497 --> 00:04:09,214
I thought you and
Tash were okay?

74
00:04:09,239 --> 00:04:10,605
No, that was just for show.

75
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:12,312
I’m not letting Tash beat me!

76
00:04:12,556 --> 00:04:13,556
Let it go, Pipay.

77
00:04:13,787 --> 00:04:16,182
They just love embarrassing people,
that’s really their thing.

78
00:04:16,206 --> 00:04:17,206
True.

79
00:04:17,689 --> 00:04:19,222
True da fire!

80
00:04:19,256 --> 00:04:22,269
Through the fire!
What a waste…

81
00:04:22,294 --> 00:04:24,300
I was planning to treat
everyone to breakfast,

82
00:04:24,325 --> 00:04:27,746
but never mind…
you don’t even believe me.

83
00:04:27,770 --> 00:04:31,004
No! No, no, no! The
soap opera’s so good!

84
00:04:31,057 --> 00:04:32,249
- Really good?
- Really good!

85
00:04:32,274 --> 00:04:33,873
You know what,
if this were on TV,

86
00:04:33,897 --> 00:04:35,385
- I’d totally watch it!
- You’d watch it?

87
00:04:35,410 --> 00:04:36,562
- I’d watch it!
- Is it number one?

88
00:04:36,587 --> 00:04:37,587
Number one!

89
00:04:37,611 --> 00:04:39,411
Oh! No, no, no, sorry, my bad.

90
00:04:39,436 --> 00:04:41,030
Right? When it’s the villain,

91
00:04:41,055 --> 00:04:45,102
they say at first they’ll fail,
but still—fight, fight, fight!

92
00:04:45,127 --> 00:04:47,296
Right! Right!

93
00:04:47,321 --> 00:04:49,135
Let’s go, let’s go!

94
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:51,694
- Let’s go!
- Let’s go, Team Hannah!

95
00:04:51,719 --> 00:04:54,047
Let’s go, Team Tso K!

96
00:04:55,624 --> 00:04:56,624
I wonder how it’s going?

97
00:05:00,756 --> 00:05:01,469
Do you want to see?

98
00:05:01,494 --> 00:05:03,261
- I’m getting excited.
- Of course, yes!

99
00:05:03,285 --> 00:05:04,361
I’m really excited about this.

100
00:05:04,486 --> 00:05:05,486
Tada!

101
00:05:05,783 --> 00:05:07,723
Oh! Wow!

102
00:05:08,216 --> 00:05:09,410
- Not bad, eh?
- Wait, wait, wait!

103
00:05:09,434 --> 00:05:10,773
It’s beautiful! So pretty!

104
00:05:10,798 --> 00:05:14,021
Titanic… Titanic…
why are you clothed?

105
00:05:14,046 --> 00:05:15,710
Weren’t you just supposed
to wear a necklace?

106
00:05:15,734 --> 00:05:18,150
Let’s redo the draw—
let’s do it again, Mariposa, come on.

107
00:05:18,175 --> 00:05:21,047
Uh… uh… Hannah?
Fine, whatever.

108
00:05:21,072 --> 00:05:22,072
Wait, why?

109
00:05:22,096 --> 00:05:23,282
Hey, hey, hey!

110
00:05:23,913 --> 00:05:24,913
- I’ll do it.
- You?

111
00:05:25,161 --> 00:05:26,561
- I’ll be your model.
- You?

112
00:05:26,672 --> 00:05:28,258
Yes! Draw me like this!

113
00:05:28,429 --> 00:05:29,776
Then if you want,

114
00:05:30,002 --> 00:05:31,944
grab the necklace too!

115
00:05:31,968 --> 00:05:32,968
Then pawn it!

116
00:05:32,993 --> 00:05:34,185
You made me a snatcher?

117
00:05:34,209 --> 00:05:35,521
That used to be your job!

118
00:05:35,546 --> 00:05:36,546
I’ve changed!

119
00:05:36,579 --> 00:05:37,579
Ahem! Don’t you know

120
00:05:37,603 --> 00:05:42,394
Babe was one of the best
graphic artists in Singapore?

121
00:05:42,419 --> 00:05:43,867
- Wow!
- What?

122
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:46,260
Before! Okay? Before.

123
00:05:46,331 --> 00:05:48,641
But now, guys,
I’m a massage therapist—

124
00:05:48,666 --> 00:05:50,701
look, I’m a massage
therapist now.

125
00:05:50,911 --> 00:05:52,605
Babe, don’t worry,

126
00:05:52,851 --> 00:05:55,837
you’ll get back to doing
what you really love—

127
00:05:56,177 --> 00:05:57,864
drawing.

128
00:05:57,889 --> 00:06:00,211
Oh, maybe when you
become a famous artist,

129
00:06:00,242 --> 00:06:01,770
- you’ll forget about me, huh?
- Yeah.

130
00:06:01,794 --> 00:06:03,686
- Oh, really?
- Don’t say that!

131
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:05,199
I promise you.

132
00:06:08,884 --> 00:06:10,380
Wait, wait, wait!

133
00:06:10,404 --> 00:06:11,538
- Oh, oh?
- What?

134
00:06:11,562 --> 00:06:13,122
In case you didn’t know, I’m…

135
00:06:13,418 --> 00:06:14,991
one of the famous ones.

136
00:06:15,016 --> 00:06:16,016
You?

137
00:06:17,044 --> 00:06:18,444
Want to see a sample?

138
00:06:18,469 --> 00:06:19,963
- Go ahead. Show us.
- Go on.

139
00:06:20,043 --> 00:06:22,024
Okay, I just need a favor.

140
00:06:22,048 --> 00:06:23,316
You need to stand over there.

141
00:06:23,340 --> 00:06:25,304
- You’re going to be my model now.
- Okay…

142
00:06:25,677 --> 00:06:26,757
Don’t you want it to be me?

143
00:06:27,350 --> 00:06:30,306
Je, Je! Kuya Je, what pose do you want?
What kind of pose?

144
00:06:30,331 --> 00:06:32,100
Up to you—just…that!

145
00:06:32,124 --> 00:06:33,124
Oh, that one!

146
00:06:33,148 --> 00:06:34,170
There!

147
00:06:34,195 --> 00:06:35,195
Just stay like that, okay?

148
00:06:35,206 --> 00:06:36,556
Don’t move too much,
Andres, okay?

149
00:06:39,842 --> 00:06:41,745
OMG!

150
00:06:41,769 --> 00:06:44,563
This therapist is so handsome!

151
00:06:44,588 --> 00:06:46,441
Seriously, bestie!
Let’s make this go viral!

152
00:06:47,944 --> 00:06:52,471
We’re here at SpaKarl now,
and there’s a hottie, omg!

153
00:06:52,705 --> 00:06:54,832
My body hurts so bad, my god!

154
00:06:55,716 --> 00:06:57,229
Kuya, can I get a massage?

155
00:06:58,691 --> 00:07:01,439
I know this guy…
that’s Norman!

156
00:07:01,463 --> 00:07:04,836
That’s Norman, right?
Wow, the oth—

157
00:07:04,861 --> 00:07:06,449
- Okay, okay, okay!
- So?

158
00:07:06,781 --> 00:07:07,881
Let’s see, let’s see!

159
00:07:08,661 --> 00:07:09,661
Is it done?

160
00:07:09,926 --> 00:07:12,308
Guys, I was so dizzy.
This was hard, really hard.

161
00:07:13,135 --> 00:07:14,531
- What a piece.
- Exhausted, exhausted.

162
00:07:14,556 --> 00:07:15,556
Here it is!

163
00:07:15,581 --> 00:07:16,581
Oh…

164
00:07:17,435 --> 00:07:18,435
Huh?

165
00:07:18,613 --> 00:07:19,613
What is this?

166
00:07:19,976 --> 00:07:21,450
I thought it was a masterpiece?

167
00:07:21,547 --> 00:07:22,780
Why does it look like okra?

168
00:07:23,211 --> 00:07:24,818
This? This?

169
00:07:24,843 --> 00:07:26,224
It almost looked human!

170
00:07:27,010 --> 00:07:28,948
You’re amazing!
If this is what you wanted,

171
00:07:28,972 --> 00:07:31,255
you should’ve drawn a
vegetable garden instead, right?

172
00:07:31,628 --> 00:07:33,402
No, that’s what
you call abstract.

173
00:07:33,427 --> 00:07:34,550
- Abstract?
- Abstract!

174
00:07:34,575 --> 00:07:36,215
Then you should’ve
drawn my cheek instead,

175
00:07:36,625 --> 00:07:37,685
that’s abstract!

176
00:07:42,057 --> 00:07:45,389
Lola, I brought you something!

177
00:07:45,414 --> 00:07:47,789
Here—turon, maruya,
and bilo-bilo.

178
00:07:48,163 --> 00:07:49,790
I don’t want that.
It might be poisoned.

179
00:07:50,088 --> 00:07:53,514
Wow, Lola, poison right away?

180
00:07:53,671 --> 00:07:54,904
Dear,

181
00:07:55,692 --> 00:07:57,732
don’t think that
just because I’m old,

182
00:07:58,245 --> 00:07:59,932
you can fool me.

183
00:08:00,447 --> 00:08:04,007
You think I don’t know you have
bad intentions for my grandkid?

184
00:08:05,567 --> 00:08:07,140
Wow, Lola!

185
00:08:07,777 --> 00:08:10,684
I even cooked your
favorite snacks for you,

186
00:08:10,709 --> 00:08:13,318
and now you’re accusing me
of trying to poison you?

187
00:08:13,705 --> 00:08:15,318
That’s harsh.

188
00:08:15,785 --> 00:08:19,045
Lola Maxi, let’s not be
too quick to judge.

189
00:08:19,396 --> 00:08:21,023
It’s embarrassing for Hannah.

190
00:08:21,996 --> 00:08:23,089
You know what,

191
00:08:23,433 --> 00:08:26,763
just bring that inside
so we can all share it.

192
00:08:26,861 --> 00:08:30,793
And show Lola that
you’re eating it too, okay?

193
00:08:31,045 --> 00:08:32,525
- That’s a good idea, Tito.
- Alright.

194
00:08:33,455 --> 00:08:34,455
Let’s go.

195
00:08:36,205 --> 00:08:37,885
Why don’t you want to come inside?
Come on.

196
00:08:39,587 --> 00:08:40,587
There you go.

197
00:08:44,589 --> 00:08:46,782
You know what,
something’s really fishy.

198
00:08:47,651 --> 00:08:48,717
Why, my dear?

199
00:08:50,001 --> 00:08:51,448
Something’s fishy, Lola.

200
00:08:51,658 --> 00:08:54,111
Hey, you guys, what do you know?

201
00:08:54,531 --> 00:08:55,531
Us?

202
00:08:56,383 --> 00:08:58,283
- Nothing!
- Nothing, Lola! Nothing at all!

203
00:08:58,725 --> 00:08:59,725
Mmm, swear?

204
00:08:59,985 --> 00:09:00,985
Swear!

205
00:09:01,544 --> 00:09:03,384
Whoever lies

206
00:09:03,878 --> 00:09:07,185
doesn’t get snacks from me and
has to take a nap in the afternoon.

207
00:09:08,664 --> 00:09:09,904
Uh, well, Lola…

208
00:09:09,929 --> 00:09:10,929
Lola…

209
00:09:14,667 --> 00:09:16,567
You know what, you’re right.

210
00:09:17,631 --> 00:09:18,777
I need to focus again.

211
00:09:19,447 --> 00:09:22,114
I have to go back
to graphic designing.

212
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:23,620
Right?

213
00:09:24,933 --> 00:09:25,933
That’s right.

214
00:09:27,045 --> 00:09:29,411
There! Your girlfriend’s texting you!

215
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:31,700
Orb?

216
00:09:32,546 --> 00:09:33,546
Huh?

217
00:09:33,986 --> 00:09:34,986
Why?

218
00:09:35,225 --> 00:09:38,645
He said Tso K asked
him to do something.

219
00:09:39,700 --> 00:09:41,819
- OMG, Andres!
- Why?

220
00:09:41,945 --> 00:09:43,339
You’re trending right now!

221
00:09:44,305 --> 00:09:45,305
Oh?

222
00:09:45,315 --> 00:09:48,608
You’re like Carrotman
and... Badjao Girl!

223
00:09:48,873 --> 00:09:52,045
Instant celebrity and
instant internet sensation!

224
00:09:52,070 --> 00:09:53,070
- Yeah!
- What the heck?

225
00:09:53,204 --> 00:09:56,284
You’re now Boy Hilot!

226
00:09:56,981 --> 00:09:58,155
Huh? How did that happen?

227
00:09:58,661 --> 00:09:59,661
You don’t remember?

228
00:09:59,911 --> 00:10:02,435
That famous influencer
posted about you—

229
00:10:02,459 --> 00:10:03,478
the one who passed by here.

230
00:10:03,502 --> 00:10:06,325
Beking Taga. He’s famous!
He posted you!

231
00:10:06,349 --> 00:10:07,596
So that’s why!

232
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:08,620
Yeah!

233
00:10:17,006 --> 00:10:19,205
Okay, easy! One at a time!

234
00:10:21,689 --> 00:10:24,021
Easy. Slow down!

235
00:10:24,414 --> 00:10:26,041
Alright, that’s enough pictures!

236
00:10:26,075 --> 00:10:27,875
Come stand behind me now! Go on!

237
00:10:27,899 --> 00:10:30,513
He’s always at the shop—
don’t you see him there?

238
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:36,001
- Andres,
-Yes, Tso K?

239
00:10:36,025 --> 00:10:38,324
you need to massage all of them.

240
00:10:38,349 --> 00:10:39,349
All—all of them?

241
00:10:39,381 --> 00:10:41,195
Tso K, that’s too many!

242
00:10:41,307 --> 00:10:42,340
What do you want—

243
00:10:42,364 --> 00:10:45,110
either you massage them,
or I fire you.

244
00:10:45,126 --> 00:10:46,248
Oh...

245
00:10:46,272 --> 00:10:48,213
So I can make big money,
you have to massage all of them!

246
00:10:48,238 --> 00:10:49,432
Ahem, ahem, ahem!

247
00:10:49,456 --> 00:10:51,951
Hello! His name isn’t Boy Hilot,
it’s Andres!

248
00:10:51,975 --> 00:10:53,915
Excuse me, excuse me.

249
00:10:53,939 --> 00:10:55,086
What’s going on here?

250
00:10:56,409 --> 00:10:58,576
Don’t cause trouble—we’re
not buying insurance.

251
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,773
Looks like you need it more—

252
00:11:00,917 --> 00:11:02,437
you’ll use it earlier anyway.

253
00:11:02,467 --> 00:11:05,163
No, wa—wait!
Let me explain, okay?

254
00:11:05,188 --> 00:11:06,957
- What is it?
- Just to be clear, Tso K…

255
