and endorsement rates.

512
00:21:39,731 --> 00:21:41,051
There, there it is.

513
00:21:41,244 --> 00:21:42,439
- Where? Which one?
- That one, right there.

514
00:21:42,463 --> 00:21:45,771
Whoa, that’s way too high,
that’s robbery!

515
00:21:45,897 --> 00:21:46,897
Complaining already?

516
00:21:46,922 --> 00:21:47,922
Tso K, complaining?

517
00:21:47,947 --> 00:21:50,559
Nothing we can do,
that’s just the standard rates now.

518
00:21:50,852 --> 00:21:52,365
It’s take it or leave it.

519
00:21:52,523 --> 00:21:53,523
Take it or leave it!

520
00:21:55,242 --> 00:21:56,595
Kuya Je, Kuya Chard…

521
00:21:57,233 --> 00:21:58,406
- It’s fine.
- Huh?

522
00:21:58,431 --> 00:21:59,431
Here’s the deal.

523
00:21:59,456 --> 00:22:03,256
Tso K, because I owe you,

524
00:22:03,570 --> 00:22:05,737
and because you’re
the uncle of the

525
00:22:05,932 --> 00:22:08,338
one and only babe of my life—

526
00:22:08,363 --> 00:22:09,376
Oh!

527
00:22:10,771 --> 00:22:11,897
I’m agreeing.

528
00:22:12,284 --> 00:22:14,017
No way? Really?

529
00:22:14,042 --> 00:22:16,635
Whoa! Yes, yes, yes, yes!

530
00:22:17,646 --> 00:22:18,846
Alright! Oh, we’re good to go!

531
00:22:19,667 --> 00:22:23,467
My babe is so blessed!
Handsome and kind!

532
00:22:23,780 --> 00:22:24,780
Kiss!

533
00:22:24,798 --> 00:22:25,959
Wait, wait, wait.

534
00:22:25,983 --> 00:22:26,983
Since he said yes,
let’s start now!

535
00:22:27,008 --> 00:22:28,008
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

536
00:22:28,174 --> 00:22:29,521
It’s not that easy!

537
00:22:29,751 --> 00:22:32,097
We’ll need to prepare
the contract first,

538
00:22:32,122 --> 00:22:35,357
and the official
signing is tomorrow!

539
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:38,639
What? But he already said yes!
He already agreed!

540
00:22:38,664 --> 00:22:40,077
- Nope, hold on!
- Contract first!

541
00:22:41,275 --> 00:22:42,275
Let me just fix this.

542
00:22:42,781 --> 00:22:43,781
There.

543
00:22:44,916 --> 00:22:45,916
Tso K…

544
00:22:46,493 --> 00:22:48,246
You’re way too fired up.

545
00:22:48,474 --> 00:22:51,542
You’re blazing, like my body!

546
00:22:51,956 --> 00:22:54,348
Cool off first,
to the left, to the right!

547
00:22:54,692 --> 00:22:57,312
He already said yes,
why are you still pushing back?

548
00:22:57,337 --> 00:22:59,218
Take it easy,
that’s how it goes.

549
00:22:59,698 --> 00:23:01,685
- Sorry.
- Show business!

550
00:23:02,503 --> 00:23:04,007
So, it’s looking like you guys
are his managers now.

551
00:23:04,032 --> 00:23:05,118
Well, that’s just how it is!

552
00:23:05,638 --> 00:23:09,712
Ladies and gentlemen!

553
00:23:10,488 --> 00:23:17,179
Today’s the contract
signing of Andres Pers,

554
00:23:17,203 --> 00:23:21,369
also known as Boy Hilot!

555
00:23:23,604 --> 00:23:24,911
Nice one, Andres!

556
00:23:27,501 --> 00:23:28,701
Sign it already!

557
00:23:30,824 --> 00:23:32,117
Boy Hilot!

558
00:23:32,782 --> 00:23:33,917
- Boy Hilot!
- Boy Hilot!

559
00:23:33,942 --> 00:23:35,601
Hey, wait, wait! Hold on!

560
00:23:35,626 --> 00:23:38,487
- Hold on a second!
- Nobody sign anything!

561
00:23:38,512 --> 00:23:40,698
- No one’s signing anything!
- No one’s signing anything!

562
00:23:40,722 --> 00:23:45,118
Wait a sec! What now, Aga?
What is it this time?

563
00:23:45,253 --> 00:23:46,467
You have no—

564
00:23:46,492 --> 00:23:48,778
- Are you serious?
- Sorry, sorry!

565
00:23:53,620 --> 00:23:54,620
Andres,

566
00:23:54,800 --> 00:23:56,573
what you’ve been waiting for…

567
00:23:57,119 --> 00:24:01,847
the creative studio, you know…

568
00:24:02,040 --> 00:24:03,433
- What about it?
- What?

569
00:24:04,365 --> 00:24:06,529
This is what you’ve
been waiting for, Andres—

570
00:24:06,635 --> 00:24:12,141
your dream job as
a graphic designer!

571
00:24:12,297 --> 00:24:13,777
- Wow!
- Yes? Yes, hello?

572
00:24:13,802 --> 00:24:15,054
- Did they call?
- Just a second.

573
00:24:15,079 --> 00:24:16,094
They’re on the phone.

574
00:24:16,173 --> 00:24:18,206
They can hear everything
we’re saying, just wait.

575
00:24:18,231 --> 00:24:19,231
Sign it already!

576
00:24:19,674 --> 00:24:21,627
Uh, here’s Andres.
Just a moment.

577
00:24:21,630 --> 00:24:23,278
Sign this one first,
sign this one first.

578
00:24:23,303 --> 00:24:24,303
Wait, wait, wait.

579
00:24:25,577 --> 00:24:29,283
Hello? This is Boy Hilo—
I mean, Andres Pers.

580
00:24:31,464 --> 00:24:32,498
Graphic designer?

581
00:24:33,413 --> 00:24:36,001
Yes! Yes, yes!

582
00:24:36,025 --> 00:24:38,609
Thank you! Thank you so much!
Thank you so much!

583
00:24:39,584 --> 00:24:40,584
So, Andres?

584
00:24:41,408 --> 00:24:44,714
Guys! I’m a graphic designer again!

585
00:24:52,300 --> 00:24:53,687
Hold up, hold up!
Because of that…

586
00:24:53,805 --> 00:24:56,266
- we’re so happy as your parents.
- Mmm!

587
00:24:56,291 --> 00:24:58,785
We’re treating all
of you at our bakery!

588
00:25:05,220 --> 00:25:10,883
- Andres! Andres! Andres!
- Andres! Andres! Andres!

589
00:25:11,257 --> 00:25:12,257
Hey!

590
00:25:12,936 --> 00:25:14,809
Wait, you still need
to sign this contract—

591
00:25:14,834 --> 00:25:16,227
what about my contract?

592
00:25:16,497 --> 00:25:18,297
Andres, sign this!

593
00:25:18,723 --> 00:25:21,471
Damn this life,
the deal fell through!

594
00:25:22,549 --> 00:25:24,075
I’m so pissed!

595
00:25:25,790 --> 00:25:26,790
Ate Hannah.

596
00:25:27,161 --> 00:25:28,207
- Ate Hannah!
- Mmm?

597
00:25:28,540 --> 00:25:30,507
So I guess you finally
got what you wanted, huh?

598
00:25:30,864 --> 00:25:35,098
Yeah. Right? You finally won.

599
00:25:35,478 --> 00:25:37,904
But don’t you feel
even a little guilty?

600
00:25:38,217 --> 00:25:40,504
What if their business
closes because of you?

601
00:25:40,974 --> 00:25:44,034
Hey, are you a newcomer
on this channel?

602
00:25:44,684 --> 00:25:45,991
That’s the point!

603
00:25:46,146 --> 00:25:48,246
That’s the goal, hello?

604
00:25:48,901 --> 00:25:51,873
As long as that Bake Haus of U
doesn’t shut down,

605
00:25:52,528 --> 00:25:54,355
this teleserye isn’t over.

606
00:25:54,895 --> 00:25:55,895
We’re all for that.

607
00:25:55,913 --> 00:25:57,073
Mmm, and there’s more, right?

608
00:25:57,334 --> 00:25:58,627
Of course, there’s more!

609
00:25:59,766 --> 00:26:04,121
And I won’t stop until
there’s nothing left of Tash.

610
00:26:04,146 --> 00:26:05,988
- You know what I’m gonna do?
- What?

611
00:26:06,918 --> 00:26:08,510
- What? It’s even on a list!
- Go on, go on!

612
00:26:08,677 --> 00:26:10,444
Oh, that’s scary!

613
00:26:11,117 --> 00:26:16,429
I’m going to crush her
into tiny little pieces.

614
00:26:16,454 --> 00:26:17,454
That’s harsh.

615
00:26:17,479 --> 00:26:19,870
Until there’s
nothing left of her.

616
00:26:19,894 --> 00:26:21,046
Just like you!

617
00:26:22,176 --> 00:26:23,176
And you!

618
00:26:23,876 --> 00:26:24,876
And you!

619
00:26:35,721 --> 00:26:37,561
Why are you sitting
here all by yourself?

620
00:26:39,104 --> 00:26:40,604
Hmm, have you eaten?

621
00:26:40,863 --> 00:26:42,586
I’m okay, I’m okay.

622
00:26:42,610 --> 00:26:43,696
You sure?

623
00:26:44,618 --> 00:26:46,378
You look a bit down.

624
00:26:47,126 --> 00:26:48,540
What’s going on?

625
00:26:49,912 --> 00:26:51,705
Nothing, just leave me be.

626
00:26:53,717 --> 00:26:56,231
Are you upset with us, Tash?

627
00:26:57,437 --> 00:27:00,213
- Huh?
- We do believe you, okay?

628
00:27:01,278 --> 00:27:03,160
- Really?
- Of course!

629
00:27:03,219 --> 00:27:05,979
Atasha, you’re our daughter.

630
00:27:06,547 --> 00:27:08,853
Then why did you take her side?

631
00:27:09,699 --> 00:27:12,039
No, look, listen.

632
00:27:12,456 --> 00:27:15,300
You lashed out right away
without any proof.

633
00:27:15,651 --> 00:27:18,757
That means you immediately
stooped to her level.

634
00:27:19,129 --> 00:27:20,129
Don’t be like that.

635
00:27:20,154 --> 00:27:21,654
We’re just trying
to teach you that…

636
00:27:21,900 --> 00:27:25,399
when someone does something
bad to you or to others,

637
00:27:25,424 --> 00:27:27,277
don’t fight back with
the same bad behavior.

638
00:27:27,403 --> 00:27:28,647
Just let them be.

639
00:27:29,073 --> 00:27:31,867
And besides, we’re only
humoring that Hannah.

640
00:27:32,117 --> 00:27:34,264
Look at what she
did to my nails!

641
00:27:34,630 --> 00:27:36,449
They look awful!
Look! They’re terrible!

642
00:27:36,474 --> 00:27:38,203
So remember this, okay?

643
00:27:38,562 --> 00:27:41,028
You know this already—
just look at your face…

644
00:27:41,703 --> 00:27:44,423
we love you so, so, so, so much.

645
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:47,526
Wherever life takes you,
Atasha, remember this—

646
00:27:47,823 --> 00:27:51,810
whatever happens in your life…

647
00:27:52,676 --> 00:27:54,222
look at your sibling

648
00:27:54,817 --> 00:27:56,177
they’re confused,

649
00:27:56,828 --> 00:27:59,798
they don’t know what to do…
are you confused too?

650
00:27:59,833 --> 00:28:01,240
- No.
- Not yet?

651
00:28:01,871 --> 00:28:03,235
- You’re okay–
- Actually–

652
00:28:03,260 --> 00:28:05,272
What I want to tell you is… we…

653
00:28:05,297 --> 00:28:07,143
It’s because of that Hannah…

654
00:28:07,167 --> 00:28:09,373
No, we’re always
right here behind you.

655
00:28:09,561 --> 00:28:10,596
Remember that for
the rest of your life,

656
00:28:10,620 --> 00:28:11,740
because you’re our daughter.

657
00:28:12,405 --> 00:28:14,611
We love you so, so, so much.

658
00:28:15,553 --> 00:28:16,986
You just don’t know it.

659
00:28:17,011 --> 00:28:18,792
We’re here for you.

660
00:28:19,518 --> 00:28:21,298
So, the question is—

661
00:28:21,802 --> 00:28:24,668
are you going to mope,
or are you going to fight?

662
00:28:25,514 --> 00:28:27,421
Of course I’ll fight! Right?

663
00:28:27,446 --> 00:28:29,374
That’s it! Always!

664
00:28:29,399 --> 00:28:30,399
Always!

665
00:28:30,454 --> 00:28:32,494
That’s how it’s done!
That’s what I’m talking about!

666
00:28:33,112 --> 00:28:35,805
Tito, Tita! Atasha…

667
00:28:35,969 --> 00:28:38,702
That’s what I’m saying, Atasha!

668
00:28:39,284 --> 00:28:40,957
You’re just too stubborn!

669
00:28:41,469 --> 00:28:44,203
All the flour keeps
getting wasted!

670
00:28:44,549 --> 00:28:46,262
It just gets thrown away!

671
00:28:46,408 --> 00:28:47,408
Yeah!

672
00:28:47,576 --> 00:28:48,576
Right?

673
00:28:48,601 --> 00:28:52,374
Good thing Hannah’s
more thrifty, right?

674
00:28:53,623 --> 00:28:55,896
- Wow, Uncle, Auntie—
- Of course!

675
00:28:55,943 --> 00:28:59,195
you’re so sweet!
And yes, I really am thrifty.

676
00:28:59,396 --> 00:29:03,939
Oh, I’ll even send
you a sack of flour.

677
00:29:03,964 --> 00:29:05,845
- Huh?
- Really?

678
00:29:05,869 --> 00:29:07,662
A whole sack—did
you hear that, Atasha?

679
00:29:07,668 --> 00:29:10,342
She’s even sending
a sack of flour!

680
00:29:10,367 --> 00:29:13,783
Oh! Make it two sacks!

681
00:29:13,808 --> 00:29:14,808
Huh?

682
00:29:16,022 --> 00:29:17,615
Why not make it three?

683
00:29:26,932 --> 00:29:27,932
Here’s your bread.

684
00:29:28,125 --> 00:29:29,517
Here.

685
00:29:30,728 --> 00:29:31,775
Just wondering,

686
00:29:32,587 --> 00:29:34,661
why do you buy bread every day?

687
00:29:34,686 --> 00:29:36,767
Don’t you ever get tired of it?

688
00:29:37,324 --> 00:29:41,675
We have European blood,
so it’s all bread for us, no rice.

689
00:29:42,044 --> 00:29:43,963
Ah, okay!

690
00:29:44,523 --> 00:29:45,576
See you tomorrow!

691
00:29:45,907 --> 00:29:47,227
- Thank you, thank you!
- Alright.

692
00:29:47,331 --> 00:29:48,331
Thanks!

693
00:29:48,428 --> 00:29:50,528
What is happening
to the world, huh?

694
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:51,600
European?

695
00:29:52,340 --> 00:29:53,460
Does he even look European?

696
00:29:54,642 --> 00:29:56,528
Hey, good morning!

697
00:29:57,370 --> 00:29:58,823
My daughter is so beautiful!

698
00:30:03,260 --> 00:30:04,380
Hi, Hannah!

699
00:30:05,044 --> 00:30:06,044
Hi!

700
00:30:06,710 --> 00:30:07,843
What can I get you?

701
00:30:10,206 --> 00:30:11,933
One ensaymada, please.

702
00:30:12,950 --> 00:30:15,574
She really won’t give up.

703
00:30:16,126 --> 00:30:19,475
No matter what happens,
I won’t give up.

704
00:30:20,097 --> 00:30:21,777
One ensaymada, coming right up.

705
00:30:29,785 --> 00:30:30,945
Oh, thank you!

706
00:30:31,454 --> 00:30:33,344
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

707
00:30:49,625 --> 00:30:52,218
Ouch! Ouch!

708
00:30:53,156 --> 00:30:54,901
- What was that?
- What happened?

709
00:30:54,928 --> 00:30:55,928
What happened?

710
00:30:55,953 --> 00:30:58,183
- Hannah!
- Oh no, there’s blood!

711
00:30:58,208 --> 00:31:00,403
- Why is there blood on that?
- Why is there blood on that?

712
00:31:00,427 --> 00:31:03,490
There’s glass in the ensaymada!

713
00:31:03,819 --> 00:31:05,134
Glass…

714
00:31:05,159 --> 00:31:06,674
There’s glass in our ensaymada?

715
00:31:06,699 --> 00:31:07,699
Yeah!

716
00:31:08,022 --> 00:31:09,182
- How did that—
- It was Tash!

717
00:31:09,408 --> 00:31:10,408
- Tash what?
- Huh?

718
00:31:10,433 --> 00:31:13,168
It was Tash who
served this to me!

719
00:31:13,193 --> 00:31:14,434
Are you sure, Hannah?

720
00:31:14,459 --> 00:31:15,807
Yes, I’m sure!

721
00:31:15,832 --> 00:31:16,832
You know,

722
00:31:17,233 --> 00:31:21,003
she really wants to hurt me—
and worse, kill me!

723
00:31:21,028 --> 00:31:22,703
- What?
- Atasha?

724
00:31:22,741 --> 00:31:24,770
Tasha? No way, impossible.

725
00:31:24,795 --> 00:31:25,795
Oh really?

726
00:31:26,481 --> 00:31:27,481
Alright then.

727
00:31:27,506 --> 00:31:28,506
Tash…

728
00:31:28,627 --> 00:31:30,147
Let’s bring out the evidence.

729
00:31:30,620 --> 00:31:32,813
Dad, please do the honors.

730
00:31:32,930 --> 00:31:34,563
- What’s this?
- What is it?

731
00:31:35,094 --> 00:31:36,154
Oh, CCTV?

732
00:31:37,543 --> 00:31:38,543
Thank you, Lola.

733
00:31:50,852 --> 00:31:51,870
Hannah?

734
00:31:51,895 --> 00:31:54,955
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

735
00:31:56,403 --> 00:31:57,996
Where do you think
you’re going? Huh?

736
00:31:58,208 --> 00:31:59,208
Where are you going?

737
00:31:59,245 --> 00:32:01,265
Just… just walking.

738
00:32:01,555 --> 00:32:03,423
- Walking?
- Walking down the road.

739
00:32:03,448 --> 00:32:05,110
Ah… okay!

740
00:32:06,472 --> 00:32:07,645
We have CCTV.

741
00:32:10,393 --> 00:32:11,659
Ah, wish we all had that!

742
00:32:12,825 --> 00:32:13,865
Yeah, wish we all did!

743
00:32:13,890 --> 00:32:16,133
Oh, was it cheap?

744
00:32:18,893 --> 00:32:19,893
Expensive?

745
00:32:20,472 --> 00:32:21,472
Lend it.

746
00:32:22,723 --> 00:32:23,723
Nope.

747
00:32:24,322 --> 00:32:25,796
Let’s go, let’s move it,
let’s move it!

748
00:32:25,821 --> 00:32:26,821
- Okay!
- Okay!

749
00:32:26,846 --> 00:32:29,543
Lights, camera, action!

750
00:32:30,553 --> 00:32:34,350
Your spa, my spa—SpaKarl!

751
00:32:34,637 --> 00:32:35,923
Best in town!

752
00:32:36,567 --> 00:32:38,447
Boy Hilot-approved!

753
00:32:40,188 --> 00:32:41,188
Yeah!

754
00:32:42,625 --> 00:32:43,625
Amazing, amazing!

755
00:32:43,644 --> 00:32:45,589
Oh, here! One more, one more!

756
00:32:45,882 --> 00:32:47,059
One more, for safety!

757
00:32:47,083 --> 00:32:48,186
- For safety!
- Ah, alright, go for it!

758
00:32:48,211 --> 00:32:50,597
Just to make sure
we get that shot!

759
00:32:50,622 --> 00:32:51,929
- To add variety!
- Yes!

760
00:32:51,954 --> 00:32:52,954
This one, this one!

761
00:32:52,965 --> 00:32:54,612
The one with the gear shift,
the one with the gear shift!

762
00:32:54,636 --> 00:32:55,636
Oh, okay! Let's go!

763
00:32:55,739 --> 00:32:58,685
Lights, camera, action!
Let’s go!

764
00:32:58,910 --> 00:32:59,910
Awesome!

765
00:33:01,458 --> 00:33:06,318
Your spa, my spa—SpaKarl!

766
00:33:07,531 --> 00:33:09,385
Best in town!

767
00:33:09,436 --> 00:33:12,666
Whoa! Amazing!

768
00:33:13,507 --> 00:33:15,182
- One more!
- Boy Hilot-approved!

769
00:33:18,613 --> 00:33:19,820
Awesome! Awesome!

770
00:33:19,845 --> 00:33:22,522
And that’s a wrap, that’s a wrap!
Thank you, thank you!

771
00:33:22,746 --> 00:33:24,724
Congratulations!

772
00:33:24,749 --> 00:33:25,962
My grandchild is so talented!

773
00:33:25,987 --> 00:33:29,216
Andres! You’re so good!
You’re really something else!

774
00:33:29,518 --> 00:33:31,093
You’re my inspiration, Dad!

775
00:33:31,117 --> 00:33:32,709
Who else would he take after?

776
00:33:32,733 --> 00:33:34,122
Yeah, who?

777
00:33:34,146 --> 00:33:35,646
Of course, me!

778
00:33:35,671 --> 00:33:37,139
That’s it!

779
00:33:37,164 --> 00:33:39,601
Of course,
that’s our child, right?

780
00:33:39,625 --> 00:33:40,625
Of course!

781
00:33:40,636 --> 00:33:42,604
- Not just handsome…
- Oh!

782
00:33:42,628 --> 00:33:43,707
Wow!

783
00:33:43,732 --> 00:33:45,598
…also caring and loving!

784
00:33:49,214 --> 00:33:51,008
Did you get everything?

785
00:33:51,033 --> 00:33:52,591
- You really look good together!
- We got everything, Tso K.

786
00:33:52,616 --> 00:33:55,882
Don’t worry, I’ll edit it
so his handsomeness

787
00:33:55,907 --> 00:33:57,496
and the spa’s beauty
really shine through!

788
00:33:57,520 --> 00:33:59,980
Oh, that’s right. Make it great!

789
00:34:00,005 --> 00:34:02,035
- Crystal clear, super clear!
- Je, make it great!

790
00:34:02,060 --> 00:34:03,294
- I’m good at this.
- Okay, okay.

791
00:34:03,318 --> 00:34:04,557
That’s what matters.

792
00:34:04,582 --> 00:34:05,883
- Tso K!
- Thanks so much.

793
00:34:05,907 --> 00:34:06,907
Of course!

794
00:34:06,932 --> 00:34:07,944
You’ve accepted to be the–

795
00:34:07,969 --> 00:34:09,363
Of course, thank you too,
thank you too!

796
00:34:09,387 --> 00:34:10,807
–endorser of SpaKarl.

797
00:34:11,130 --> 00:34:13,470
And congratulations
on your new job, too!

798
00:34:13,495 --> 00:34:14,495
Yes, thank you!

799
00:34:15,141 --> 00:34:19,227
Finally, it’s done!
Thank you, Mom, thank you, Dad!

800
00:34:19,599 --> 00:34:20,925
- Where?
- Where?

801
00:34:20,950 --> 00:34:22,158
Come on!

802
00:34:22,182 --> 00:34:25,021
Of course, for teaching me
to be tough and to stand on my own.

803
00:34:25,045 --> 00:34:28,114
Also, Lola, thank you for
being the best grandma ever.

804
00:34:28,139 --> 00:34:31,260
- Yes, of course!
- You’re welcome, my dear!

805
00:34:31,455 --> 00:34:32,455
You know…

806
00:34:33,362 --> 00:34:34,488
You know, Tasha…

807
00:34:34,912 --> 00:34:38,038
Atasha, your toughness,
that spirit—

808
00:34:38,649 --> 00:34:41,092
I also thought of
teaching that to Andres.

809
00:34:41,719 --> 00:34:44,036
Andres, as a son,

810
00:34:44,656 --> 00:34:45,656
as your father,

811
00:34:46,193 --> 00:34:48,453
you also need to
strengthen your heart.

812
00:34:50,085 --> 00:34:52,418
Don’t… don’t let yourself be swayed by…

813
00:34:54,412 --> 00:34:55,650
Thanks, Dad!

814
00:34:55,675 --> 00:34:58,560
Ah, you’re the best!

815
00:34:59,840 --> 00:35:01,287
- Oh, what’s that?
- What’s that?

816
00:35:01,312 --> 00:35:03,172
- That’s the tension!
- Maybe it got pinched!

817
00:35:03,197 --> 00:35:04,197
That’s it!

818
00:35:04,223 --> 00:35:07,034
- Guys… I’m leaving.
- Oh.

819
00:35:07,098 --> 00:35:09,824
I accept my defeat.

820
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:17,720
Oh, why are you crying?

821
00:35:17,745 --> 00:35:19,530
Tso K, it’s because of them!

822
00:35:19,975 --> 00:35:22,329
It’s them!
They’re making me cry!

823
00:35:22,353 --> 00:35:23,353
- Us?
- Us?

824
00:35:23,378 --> 00:35:25,266
Are you making her cry, huh?

825
00:35:25,318 --> 00:35:26,651
Liar! Liar!

826
00:35:27,412 --> 00:35:29,628
- Don’t make me mad!
- Tso K! Tso K!

827
00:35:29,652 --> 00:35:31,213
- Mmm?
- The endorsements!

828
00:35:31,237 --> 00:35:32,481
Endorsement?

829
00:35:32,505 --> 00:35:33,610
- Mmm. Endorsements.
- Oh?

830
00:35:33,617 --> 00:35:34,681
- There’s Heart…
- Hannah!

831
00:35:34,872 --> 00:35:37,085
I think you should go back
to the province for now.

832
00:35:37,129 --> 00:35:38,916
Go on, head home for now, okay?

833
00:35:40,924 --> 00:35:41,924
True da fire!

834
00:35:44,718 --> 00:35:45,732
Remember this—

835
00:35:45,757 --> 00:35:47,323
Oh, someone’s out for revenge!

836
00:35:47,986 --> 00:35:49,890
- It’s just a threat for now!
- You! You!

837
00:35:49,914 --> 00:35:51,462
- Me?
- You all…

838
00:35:54,100 --> 00:35:56,007
You’re handsome, but…

839
00:35:56,031 --> 00:35:57,031
You!

840
00:35:57,266 --> 00:35:58,566
Okay… I’ll say the—

841
00:35:58,591 --> 00:36:00,370
You! You!

842
00:36:00,792 --> 00:36:01,792
You!

843
00:36:01,944 --> 00:36:03,238
You!

844
00:36:03,262 --> 00:36:04,996
You’re not wearing underwear!

845
00:36:05,020 --> 00:36:06,103
No underwear…

846
00:36:06,128 --> 00:36:07,297
Especially you!

847
00:36:07,636 --> 00:36:08,636
Oh?

848
00:36:09,047 --> 00:36:10,453
This isn’t over.

849
00:36:11,173 --> 00:36:13,739
Stay tuned for the next episode.

850
00:36:17,910 --> 00:36:20,130
So, what are we waiting for?

851
00:36:20,155 --> 00:36:21,155
Huh?

852
00:36:21,178 --> 00:36:24,425
Let’s watch Andres’
endorsement video!

853
00:36:28,459 --> 00:36:30,125
Let’s watch it! Come on!

854
00:36:30,150 --> 00:36:31,550
Andres, do you have
anything to say?

855
00:36:32,320 --> 00:36:34,660
Not really.
I’m just shy because...

856
00:36:34,828 --> 00:36:36,189
there are so many of us here
and you all want to watch it.

857
00:36:36,213 --> 00:36:37,962
Maybe—it’s not us
you’re shy around.

858
00:36:37,987 --> 00:36:39,947
Maybe it’s just one person
you’re shy around, huh?

859
00:36:41,697 --> 00:36:44,221
What is it really?
We’re confused too!

860
00:36:44,246 --> 00:36:45,246
Come on, hey!

861
00:36:45,271 --> 00:36:47,965
Let’s watch it already!
Let’s watch it!

862
00:36:48,986 --> 00:36:50,833
This is so high-definition, 4K!

863
00:36:51,019 --> 00:36:52,614
- 4K!
- Wow!

864
00:36:52,639 --> 00:36:53,639
Do you have data?

865
00:36:53,664 --> 00:36:54,664
Just a second.

866
00:36:55,598 --> 00:36:56,598
There.

867
00:36:56,623 --> 00:36:58,555
- Alright, alright, alright!
- Okay!

868
00:36:58,632 --> 00:36:59,999
- Safe, safe.
- Just so…

869
00:37:02,613 --> 00:37:04,366
What are you hiding in there?

870
00:37:04,391 --> 00:37:06,421
The… no… the thing,
kababayan bread.

871
00:37:07,396 --> 00:37:08,976
I put it in my pocket.

872
00:37:09,001 --> 00:37:10,175
Wait, wait, wait!

873
00:37:10,199 --> 00:37:11,631
We might miss it.
Stand over here, over here.

874
00:37:11,656 --> 00:37:14,431
Go there, go there, so… there!

875
00:37:16,834 --> 00:37:19,433
- Thanks, girl!
- Do you need me to hold it?

876
00:37:19,458 --> 00:37:20,884
No need! No need, I’m good!

877
00:37:20,909 --> 00:37:22,089
- Here it is, I’ll play it now!
- Oh, game!

878
00:37:22,113 --> 00:37:24,090
Oh, let’s count down,
we need to for Andres.

879
00:37:24,141 --> 00:37:26,226
Alright, alright, alright, alright!

880
00:37:26,299 --> 00:37:28,899
Three… Two… One!

881
00:37:29,659 --> 00:37:32,093
Oh, do it well,
repeat your line, okay.

882
00:37:32,119 --> 00:37:32,711
Alright, oh, let’s go!

883
00:37:32,867 --> 00:37:34,867
Lights, camera, action!

884
00:37:37,090 --> 00:37:38,548
- Oh.
- Why is it like that?

885
00:37:42,503 --> 00:37:45,043
- No, no, there’s more.
- Why is it you on the screen?

886
00:37:45,068 --> 00:37:46,388
Wasn’t this supposed
to be Andres?

887
00:37:50,110 --> 00:37:51,110
What is this?

888
00:37:59,509 --> 00:38:03,037
Tomorrow is the auditions
for the 2025 Queen of Sagala!

889
00:38:03,653 --> 00:38:05,259
I kinda want to audition.

890
00:38:05,410 --> 00:38:07,236
Tso K, I’m joining this!

891
00:38:07,261 --> 00:38:09,513
You bounce from
side to side like this!

892
00:38:09,538 --> 00:38:11,544
I was hoping to get a massage.

893
00:38:11,568 --> 00:38:13,186
I don’t do massages.

894
00:38:13,211 --> 00:38:14,539
You can’t say no to that—

895
00:38:14,563 --> 00:38:16,461
- she’s the Hermana Mayor!
- Oh, yes!

896
00:38:16,582 --> 00:38:18,116
That’s a pleasure!

897
00:38:18,779 --> 00:38:20,852
Oh my, Tash,
if it weren’t for you…

898
00:38:20,877 --> 00:38:26,041
You know, someone with a trashy
attitude shouldn’t be a queen anyway.

899
00:38:27,632 --> 00:38:28,632
Hey, Tash!

900
00:38:28,883 --> 00:38:31,176
Alright, I’ll be the one
to distract Hannah.

901
00:38:31,220 --> 00:38:36,036
Here in Barangay Singko,
we’re kind and loving.

902
00:38:36,753 --> 00:38:39,127
If Hannah finds out,
you’re on your own, okay?

903
00:38:39,152 --> 00:38:40,531
What is it I need to know?

904
00:38:40,611 --> 00:38:41,931
That you’re like a giant blood.
